# Shell scripts here are executed via `shell: bash` even on windows-latest, where
# GitHub's runner image sets core.autocrlf=true; a CRLF checkout makes bash fail on
# the first line ($'\r': command not found). Pin LF so correctness does not depend on
# the clone machine's git config.
#
# Scoped to *.sh on purpose: applying a blanket rule would rewrite the working-tree
# line endings of the existing .py / .yaml files and bury this change in noise.
*.sh text eol=lf
